      ],
      "source": "https://townofstillwaterny.gov/about/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Stillwater Blockhouse, built during the Revolutionary War, now sits in a riverside park on Hudson Avenue.",
